note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note slices writes every contiguous run of k bytes of s, in order, joined by commas, into o and
note returns the number of bytes written; or -1 when s is empty, -2 when k is negative, -3 when k is
note zero, -4 when k is longer than s.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/series
om2
fn slices s view uchar * k long o edit uchar * to long
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
